# Justified exceptions to tools/vocabulary.rules.
#
# One exception per line, three tab-separated fields:
#   path           a file path relative to the repository root, with forward slashes
#   rule           the id of the rule that does not apply to that file
#   justification  one line saying why; an entry without one fails the lint
#
# Lines starting with # and blank lines are ignored.

crates/daemon/Cargo.toml	provider-tangent	The daemon composes the compiled-in service adapter and depends on its crate.
crates/daemon/Cargo.toml	provider-atproto	The daemon composes the compiled-in credential adapter and depends on its crate.
docs/adr/0001-seven-nouns.md	provider-tangent	The founding ADR names the first service adapter, its crate and the ship line.
docs/adr/0001-seven-nouns.md	provider-atproto	The founding ADR names the first credential adapter, its crate and the owner's account kind.
docs/adr/0001-seven-nouns.md	provider-bluesky	The founding ADR names the second service adapter that follows the ship line.
crates/daemon/tests/remember_journey.rs	stale-files	The journey plants a file of that name to show the daemon never reads it.
crates/daemon/src/http/feed_body.rs	identifiers	Implementing hyper's Body names the standard library's std::task::Context; it is no lobby handle.
crates/daemon/src/http/feed_body.rs	context	Implementing hyper's Body names the standard library's std::task::Context; it is no lobby handle.
crates/conformance/src/host.rs	session	The scenario asserts that this word never reaches a mind's tool list.
crates/conformance/src/host.rs	context	The scenario asserts that this word never reaches a mind's tool list.
crates/conformance/Cargo.toml	provider-atproto	The conformance suite's tests hold the atproto credential adapter to its contract.
crates/conformance/tests/atproto_credential.rs	provider-atproto	The credential suite runs against the atproto adapter and the test kit's fake of its provider.
crates/daemon/src/registry.rs	provider-atproto	The registry is the one place the daemon composes the compiled-in credential adapter.
crates/daemon/src/bin/synthetic.rs	provider-atproto	The test-only command composes the credential adapter against the test kit's fake world.
crates/daemon/tests/sign_in_journey.rs	provider-atproto	The journey signs companions in with the atproto adapter through the real daemon against the test kit's fake.
crates/daemon/tests/manager_journey.rs	provider-atproto	The journey walks the sponsor's moments against the test kit's fake world, signing in with the atproto adapter.
crates/daemon/tests/trouble_journey.rs	provider-atproto	The journey keeps an atproto credential alive and revokes it through the real daemon against the test kit's fake.
crates/services/tangent/src/profile.rs	provider-atproto	A Space names itself by a did:web DID, which the adapter derives to check the audience the profile names; it is Tangent's own wire.
crates/testkit/src/space.rs	provider-tangent	The test kit's fake of the Space the Tangent adapter speaks to, in that Space's own wire words.
crates/conformance/Cargo.toml	provider-tangent	The conformance suite's tests hold the Tangent service adapter to its contract.
crates/conformance/tests/tangent_service.rs	provider-tangent	The service suite runs against the Tangent adapter and the test kit's fake Space.
crates/conformance/tests/tangent_service.rs	provider-atproto	The fake Space takes proofs the atproto adapter mints at the test kit's fake PDS.
crates/conformance/tests/tangent_service.rs	provider-atproto-wire	The fake Space takes proofs the atproto adapter mints at the test kit's fake PDS.
crates/daemon/src/registry.rs	provider-tangent	The registry is the one place the daemon composes the compiled-in service adapter with the credential adapter its Spaces take.
crates/daemon/src/bin/synthetic.rs	provider-tangent	The test-only command composes the service adapter for the test kit's fake Space.
crates/daemon/tests/manager_journey.rs	provider-tangent	The journey checks the services the page offers, the Tangent adapter among them.
crates/daemon/tests/sign_in_journey.rs	provider-tangent	The journey checks the product offers the Tangent adapter for atproto accounts.
crates/testkit/src/world.rs	provider-tangent	The whole fake world seeds the fake Space in its own nouns: Tangents, Topics and Posts.
crates/testkit/tests/lobby_world.rs	provider-tangent	The test probes the fake Space at its own well-known path.
crates/daemon/tests/space_journey.rs	provider-tangent	The journey connects a companion to the test kit's fake Space through the real daemon and the Tangent adapter.
crates/daemon/tests/space_journey.rs	provider-atproto	The journey signs the companion in with the atproto adapter against the test kit's fake world.
crates/daemon/tests/space_journey.rs	provider-atproto-wire	The journey checks the proof the fake PDS minted.
crates/testkit/src/hosts.rs	provider-tangent	A recorded mind calls the Tangent adapter's tools by the names its host saw.
crates/testkit/fixtures/hosts/claude-code-2.1.303-space.jsonl	provider-tangent	The frames a real host exchanged with the lobby while its mind used the Tangent adapter's tools.
crates/testkit/fixtures/manager/companion-accounts.txt	provider-tangent	The page's recorded text names the installed service by its title.
crates/testkit/fixtures/manager/companion-trouble.txt	provider-tangent	The page's recorded text names the installed service by its title.
